  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now on taking conjugate both side we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtext>Note</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now subtracting both equations we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math> (not possible) or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtext>as</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>i</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>i</mi></math></p><p>Now putting the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;in given equation we get,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Now solving,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced></math></p></blockquote>",
